        <li><a href="https://www.fitbit.com/content/assets/help/manuals/manual_charge_5_en_US.pdf" rel="nofollow">Fitbit Charge 5 user manual — Use the EDA Scan app</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.google.com/fitbit/answer/14237928?hl=en" rel="nofollow">Fitbit / Google Health Help — Manage stress &amp; mindfulness (Stress Management Score)</a></li>
