    </div>

    <div id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <FAQ items={faqs} />
    </div>
    <RelatedLinks links={related} />

    <aside class="mt-6 app-card p-5 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
      <strong class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Not medical advice.</strong> This page is educational. Fitbit, Google and Cortisol+ wearable scores are not hormone tests. For diagnosis, testing, or treatment of any medical condition, consult a qualified healthcare provider.
